## 2. Sidebar — navegação global

Compartilhada entre todas as telas. Largura fixa `220px`. Background: `var(--color-gray-50)`.

### 2.1 Estrutura de layout

```css
.sidebar {
  width: 220px;
  min-width: 220px;
  height: 100vh;
  overflow-y: auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  padding: 16px 12px;
  gap: 2px;
  background: var(--color-gray-50);
  border-right: 0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);
}
```

3 zonas: **Brand** (topo) · **Navegação** (meio) · **Footer** (rodapé com `margin-top: auto`)

### 2.2 Brand block

```css
.sidebar-brand {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 10px 8px 18px;
  border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.brand-icon {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: #D85A30;
  color: white;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 500;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
```

- Texto do produto: `12px / 500 / --color-text-primary`
- Email do usuário: `11px / 400 / --color-text-secondary`

### 2.3 Nav items

```css
.nav-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 9px 10px;
  border-radius: var(--border-radius-md);
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 0.15s;
