```

**Separador de data:**

```html
<div style="text-align:center;">
  <span style="background:var(--color-background-secondary); border:0.5px solid var(--color-border-tertiary); border-radius:20px; padding:5px 14px; font-size:11px; color:var(--color-text-tertiary);">
    <i class="ti ti-calendar"></i> Hoje, 09 jun 2026
